        },
        "category": "defensive",
        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> A creature within 30 feet damages Solarius.</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Solarius focuses his divine ire on a single creature, forcing them to kneel. The triggering creature must make a @Check[type:will|dc:36|basic:false] with the following effects:</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The triggering creature is unaffected and is immune to \"Kneel, Interloper!\" for 24 hours. </p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The triggering creature resists the urge to kneel, but is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.AJh5ex99aV6VTggg]{Off-Guard} for 1 round. </p>\n<p><strong>Failure </strong>The triggering creature kneels in forced deference to Solarius. The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The triggering creature prostrates themselves before Solarius' divine glory. The triggering creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.j91X7x0XSomq8d60]{Prone} and cannot Stand until the end of their next turn. </p>"
        },
        "frequency": {
          "max": 1,
          "per": "round",
          "value": 1
        },
        "publication": {
          "authors": "",
          "license": "OGL",
