          "value": "<p>Solarius targets one creature within 30 feet, materialising the spiritual weight of their guilt. The creature must make a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:34|basic:false] saving throw. On a failure, the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.HL2l2VRSaQHu9lUw]{Fatigued} and all of their speeds are reduced by 10 feet. The creature may spend an action verbalising their guilt to lift the weight, ending the effect. </p>"
